"[`command/arms_target_manager/config/default.yaml`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_target_manager/config/default.yaml)"
" or a robot `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml`."
msgstr ""
"`arms_target_manager` 还会读取 "
"[`command/arms_target_manager/config/default.yaml`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_target_manager/config/default.yaml)，或机型的"
" `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml`。"

