"`main` is still [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48)). "
"After that PR merges, the same wording is on `main`."
msgstr ""
"表上的 **仅启动 / 运行时** 标记与 [arms_ros2_control #120](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/pull/120) 的公开控制器 README 一致（分支提交 "
"`e1b7a147`；`main` 上的代码仍钉在 [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48)）。该 "
"PR 合并后，`main` 上的措辞相同。"

