#: 6dc2f4d94aa449e3b518310def775727
msgid ""
"Declared, but there is no callback or clear re-read path. The READMEs in "
"#120 mark **none** of the previously documented keys this way."
msgstr "已声明，但没有回调也没有清晰的重读路径。#120 的 README **没有**把此前已文档化的键标成这一类。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:45
#: 695cb43d16504038b261a93530c7ace4
