"[ros2_control here](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md), [分体控制 vs "
"全身控制](../../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md), [Driver "
"layer](../../4-reference/hardware/0-index.md). The internal Feishu 运控架构图 "
"is whiteboard-only and is not redrawn here."
